sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as User / Frontend (Next.js)
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Gateway (Port 8000)
    participant Redis as Redis 7 Broker & Queues
    participant WorkerT1 as Tier 1: Scraper Worker (Playwright)
    participant S3 as MinIO S3 Object Store (gem-tenders)
    participant WorkerT2 as Tier 2: Document Worker (PyMuPDF)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 18 (gem-bridge)
    participant WorkerT3 as Tier 3: ATC & Vector Worker (Gemini/BGE)

    %% Trigger & Ingestion Phase
    Note over Client,WorkerT1: Phase 1: Triggering & Zero-Disk In-Memory Ingestion
    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/tasks/trigger-scrape?bid_type=all
    Gateway->>Redis: Enqueue task to 'scraping_queue'
    Gateway-->>Client: 202 Accepted (task_id, status=queued)
    
    Redis->>WorkerT1: Dispatch scrape task
    WorkerT1->>WorkerT1: Launch Stealth Chromium (/dev/shm)
    WorkerT1->>Redis: Check Bloom Filter (gem:seen:{bid_no})
    alt Bid is New / Not Seen
        WorkerT1->>S3: Stream raw PDF directly to bids/{bid_no}/bid.pdf
        WorkerT1->>Redis: Enqueue process_bid_document to 'document_queue'
    else Bid Already Processed
        WorkerT1->>WorkerT1: Skip download (Deduplicated)
    end

    %% Document Normalization Phase
    Note over WorkerT2,PG: Phase 2: High-Speed In-Memory Parsing & ACID Persistence
    Redis->>WorkerT2: Dispatch process_bid_document
    WorkerT2->>S3: Stream raw PDF bytes into memory
    WorkerT2->>WorkerT2: PyMuPDF slices front pages (<0.2s)
    WorkerT2->>WorkerT2: Parse structured tables & normalize values
    WorkerT2->>S3: Upload document.md & metadata.json
    WorkerT2->>PG: ACID Multi-Table Upsert (bids, items, consignees, schedules, terms)
    WorkerT2->>Redis: Enqueue process_atc_and_embed to 'atc_rag_queue'

    %% AI Compliance & Semantic Indexing Phase
    Note over WorkerT3,PG: Phase 3: AI Legal Compliance & pgvector Indexing
    Redis->>WorkerT3: Dispatch process_atc_and_embed
    WorkerT3->>S3: Fetch metadata.json boundary context
    WorkerT3->>WorkerT3: Gemini 2.5 Flash analyzes 8 Legal Domains
    WorkerT3->>PG: Upsert bid_atc_checklist_items & physical_submissions
    WorkerT3->>PG: Log LLM token consumption in bid_atc_analyses
    WorkerT3->>S3: Upload atc_compliance.json
    WorkerT3->>WorkerT3: BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 chunks text & embeds 768-dim vectors
    WorkerT3->>PG: Bulk insert gem_bid_chunks (HNSW Cosine Index)

    %% Retrieval & Client Consumption
    Note over Client,PG: Phase 4: Fast Client Retrieval & Document Streaming
    Client->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/bids/{bid_no}/items
    Gateway->>PG: SELECT * FROM bid_items WHERE bid_no = :bid_no
    PG-->>Gateway: Return items slice
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK (Clean Pydantic JSON)

    Client->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/search?q=laptops&mode=semantic
    Gateway->>WorkerT3: Compute query embedding (768-dim)
    Gateway->>PG: Cosine distance search on gem_bid_chunks (<=>)
    PG-->>Gateway: Top-K semantic chunks + metadata
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK (Ranked search results)

    Client->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/documents/{bid_no}/pdf
    Gateway->>S3: Generate presigned GET URL (<15ms)
    Gateway-->>Client: 307 Temporary Redirect (Direct MinIO CDN stream)
